<title>FINLAND: FINNISH INSURER TAPIOLA DETAILS GROUP 1996 RESULTS.</title>
<headline>FINNISH INSURER TAPIOLA DETAILS GROUP 1996 RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish mutual insurance group Tapiola-yhtiot said in a statement on Thursday that the group's turnover increased to 8.2 billion markka in 1996 from 6.1 billion the previous year.</p>
<p>Thanks to healthy earnings, Tapiola policy holders would benefit through lower premium payments, it said.</p>
</text>
